  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00001",
      "source_hash": "e5c454b238f72348fa79bac98e40d2d38132af9ba07445cdcb971d3941e8c1ad",
      "text": "■ 《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法施行规则》〔附表格式第十一号〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "01266b955d76bd091c95ac61231dcb93c688eb267ee40782751d89bf7bc09e67",
      "text": "人口贩运等受害者支援设施变更指定申请书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "3afa30237582a4280535fa3dc6008b385fd5306dc0db75f5958328394e48b1e5",
      "text": "（〔 〕设施负责人 〔 〕所在地 〔 〕名称 〔 〕入住定员）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "12671009564bad8a6f8594cf96b05b9a8bacc8121812f4eed87e72a0cfb4d6ed",
      "text": "※在〔 〕内相应位置打√，深色底纹栏由申请人留空。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "b736160e9f7f0d321a2b458369e87ad0a76a9b7c00b4454ad463a28ce8d1d95b",
      "text": "受理编号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "5a4e38a1578eaec376cc5e1ad28f33f019956fc98d46f14b142cad94c5b1d1a5",
      "text": "受理日期和时间"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "73bb6cce4a51c9be6d75cb4162609abed97cc4d3f5abdac1312e42797089d001",
      "text": "办理日期"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "135b2d53c337583773ec05ac31eb1e280c78db754abfe7dcfb462196f269bdae",
      "text": "姓名（代表人）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "fcf499d943a69cd0a7f49a2f56d1f62c47ab38e4a8a46df75dba413fe834c156",
      "text": "出生年月日（法人登记号码）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "6bb977cc7fd9abf728aee5d61d7beddddd356404bd01ccf71ae740fb12c87720",
      "text": "法人名称"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "d6190fb77a7ff6d9c9ed4b3404454b31c394bfcb69afd9e10bf3affcb9d022f7",
      "text": "设施概况"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "29ad7bb4251e915977238e64bb020baba7b10218df699d53afa3a7516c5ad664",
      "text": "支援设施名称"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "0ee7e84e73cfe73f165915daea92e9373cfd27e0e61d9edd755ad5eecbad73d4",
      "text": "支援设施负责人姓名"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "83a2d58e6e4023f8099cd507177e590775a24fddf563f9101d439d18eeef9872",
      "text": "变更年月日"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "467d305bfbe5e83a8a6e0bb6cb5811b4dcbb6a04a9c274f30d8fc20c201f3433",
      "text": "变更事项"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "0c263cac5947d01e4f69892f89149e14c2922831c2afc7ebaf29274b3d71c1ed",
      "text": "变更前"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "e5ac93c257305de93a487c1ced0a64993a58dab1ab2b277227fa514e6d658068",
      "text": "设施负责人姓名"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "ef4403031e6e67eb6ff612ac7f030ff5fcf2e12e2b56fe2fa253adc78b0c68bb",
      "text": "所在地"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "cc34819ae36ea34311525bea3cd52af69eface48c58317c2293ce3dea3eff86c",
      "text": "变更后"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "e5ac93c257305de93a487c1ced0a64993a58dab1ab2b277227fa514e6d658068",
      "text": "设施负责人姓名"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "ef4403031e6e67eb6ff612ac7f030ff5fcf2e12e2b56fe2fa253adc78b0c68bb",
      "text": "所在地"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "32b9a520a9ad16779b43460451e01e1776b3410847ec8d5647e90d7842a12190",
      "text": "依《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法》第三十三条第二款、同法施行令第二十三条第四款及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "778bbff1c7f0fe86a39a2d78afd8aa5fbf3bd10e3bb62b857894411f42aeae37",
      "text": "同法施行规则第八条第四款，申请对上述人口贩运等受害者支援设施的指定事项作如下变更。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "1d1d6533ed1e48d64e83cf8d903f5d666c88d7c717944e71110d126c0735009f",
      "text": "特别市长、广域市长、特别自治市长"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "2099cd7f323c38ac89f0ebc4dd140529ccb048fb87aa42935038b81b0325020d",
      "text": "致"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "ab0b5ba13ec0336f46db4802624f969e03cf2db64183ac6a0e2bc3955d7325f1",
      "text": "道知事、特别自治道知事"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "90c592621154c95a8fb9b73dbe3665fd29f724a4f20758fa586607dc4c70ea07",
      "text": "市长、郡守、区厅长"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "9e4d337241d87c730597b1166b30d477ff6f20827a816d8080f4e572629ad8b8",
      "text": "1. 人口贩运等受害者支援设施指定书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "0313408cdf794fea03a1b1d6758e8ad6cc7c6a9f70b7256de98dafab6a45bf1a",
      "text": "手续费"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "9b9f765e005f6811c5e986daa041057cea83f9af6c19ca7d70a7ef3c9ab707c9",
      "text": "申请人提交文件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00048",
      "source_hash": "3d3d51df18ea40ee37d9093efef2002de7209f94751479a50e3c9e8282d4ca35",
      "text": "2. 租赁合同（仅限设施所在地变更且租赁不动产的情形）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00049",
      "source_hash": "72ea3d64ace5bc9414498b815d4305c8867b0942a508179e0657ad60d1274daa",
      "text": "无"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00051",
      "source_hash": "7ef82caf97ec4584a766baee9d786d834efe16e56bcb87b5de41d81e97f865cb",
      "text": "3. 标示变更后支援设施各结构部分面积的平面图（仅在支援设施"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00052",
      "source_hash": "635d1cb764ae8b19acf10b69ed7a6c868a244876cbb226c6d29d8eb9edf00849",
      "text": "所在地变更时适用）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00053",
      "source_hash": "e3154138963e306b144b4ed58c04173309c9aa0d9fd6638357c4548386958d73",
      "text": "4. 证明支援设施负责人资格的文件（仅在负责人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00054",
      "source_hash": "f378bb6c7bbf071164aa1358c090433f60d5162dfb823be65e5da52a87cf44b9",
      "text": "变更时适用）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00055",
      "source_hash": "ee9bf14d09be7ad21eb1ad1921ed2756aea57cf7fd3c63be5d84688b8e8556a3",
      "text": "5. 设施及财产使用、处分计划书（仅在设施所在地变更时"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00056",
      "source_hash": "81a6c1a9071a799978b9b558555ae70a40fccbe5f0c730d34bf2b4fbf69f9c58",
      "text": "适用）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00057",
      "source_hash": "82c796e213293b7f12aa9afda2e9e47efd3cee40bc6812813dae484e13946787",
      "text": "6. 入住者安置措施计划书（仅在设施所在地及入住定员发生变更时适用）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00059",
      "source_hash": "b827c74bf8d6e87420e0f5fbb59551e36f9d2f125502ccc70f9f11139bd8294d",
      "text": "经办公务员"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00060",
      "source_hash": "19f6628f64e34858adbff5edae175fb444aa65584c72ac93ab8cf0b4dadd90a6",
      "text": "建筑物登记事项证明书及土地登记事项证明书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00061",
      "source_hash": "1a5be3c5938c8c2cedf096bb1485ce5f53335572edc7c3dbbf132e7bf9927045",
      "text": "核实事项"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00062",
      "source_hash": "c9b10df2527127ea18b556946c54ecd34af4184b48195d70f5331c986474353a",
      "text": "本人同意经办公务员为办理本申请，依《电子政府法》第三十六条第一款，通过行政信息共同利用机制"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00063",
      "source_hash": "8039545810c56c1326e547bcc99867fb23d8932f3a5c8679eb13a813dd61ea19",
      "text": "核实上述经办公务员核实事项。* 如不同意，申请人须自行提交相关文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00066",
      "source_hash": "2879222415672d201abfe3e634d8339e67e1459aae97a4f34b023760aaf0d94f",
      "text": "办理流程"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00067",
      "source_hash": "88f80dd5ada649927ddfb4f6efcb26d901255303a7efd945c0af6aeeb0f6941f",
      "text": "填写变更申请书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00068",
      "source_hash": "d995d6ab415d91d191bafde064de400b1e66d82532d91ec0cc02d72258ce5cda",
      "text": "受理"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00071",
      "source_hash": "d1847ed914f925a6f17d2619638ae121520c37a6462d9b0a6d54c9d0f11449ae",
      "text": "变更指定书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00072",
      "source_hash": "fc0aec8efc9cf7434964f86433311e24f2998ef6e36c7e3904222fa29065b276",
      "text": "签发"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00073",
      "source_hash": "4f961469c457130737f277d3bf7109e25b7b49eeb89e618f98200b9f308ad3d3",
      "text": "制作"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00075",
      "source_hash": "9396c10d93302dbba9312782ff942498dad6175d8204a0d88924939ea947eee9",
      "text": "市、道"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00076",
      "source_hash": "9396c10d93302dbba9312782ff942498dad6175d8204a0d88924939ea947eee9",
      "text": "市、道"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00077",
      "source_hash": "9396c10d93302dbba9312782ff942498dad6175d8204a0d88924939ea947eee9",
      "text": "市、道"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00078",
      "source_hash": "9396c10d93302dbba9312782ff942498dad6175d8204a0d88924939ea947eee9",
      "text": "市、道"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00079",
      "source_hash": "0248793fbf588e5a70331f74a4b2fb1b4b3b963a155976d13c5a8dbcc1200eab",
      "text": "市、郡、区"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00080",
      "source_hash": "0248793fbf588e5a70331f74a4b2fb1b4b3b963a155976d13c5a8dbcc1200eab",
      "text": "市、郡、区"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00081",
      "source_hash": "0248793fbf588e5a70331f74a4b2fb1b4b3b963a155976d13c5a8dbcc1200eab",
      "text": "市、郡、区"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26703-zh-00082",
